g fix in my code:\r\n\r\n```\r\n# FIXME: SQLAlchemy issue in 1.4.16\r\nif hasattr(JoinTargetImpl, '_skip_clauseelement_for_target_match'):\r\n    JoinTargetImpl._skip_clauseelement_for_target_match = False\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce there is new release fixing this I will remove my temporary fix.\r\n\r\nAgain, thank you for the quick response.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/850843743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"afetek","id":4533155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzMxNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4533155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek","html_url":"https://github.com/afetek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/afetek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/850847424","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6558#issuecomment-850847424","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6558","id":850847424,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1MDg0NzQyNA==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","grav